    "updated_at": "2017-05-11T13:03:15Z",
    "body": "OK, that isn't totally surprising, but I assume that it will become not active shortly after and that at least firing events on it isn't actually something we want. (Even more weird would be if the events are queued and then arrive if the document becomes active again.)",
